# Velo needs no secrets, and this file is deliberately an EXAMPLE that is never
# activated: bin/_common.sh only invokes cush-tools/bin/inject when a real
# `.cush-secrets` exists, so a secret-free project simply never creates one.
#
# If secrets ever do arrive they are Infisical refs. op:// is the legacy backend
# and must not be introduced here.
#
# PORT=inf://prod/velo/PORT
